global._Yq=_8o("Strings","l_creditscontrol","[%0] Skip#[%1] Fast Forward");global._Zq=_8o("Strings","l_desc_beg","[b]The Beginning[/b]#A training ship for the space repairsman elite, the Mobility. They're regarded as superheroes in most corners of the galaxy, and as such, they take their training institutions incredibly serious. It's a small ship, with housing for a few persons and a warp room to teleport to ships in trouble.");global.__q=_8o("Strings","l_desc_arr","[b]The Arrowhead[/b]#A small spaceship. It's [b]signature move[/b] is its ability to drill through almost all materials known in the galaxy, which makes it very useful in offenses to [b]drill through ship hulls[/b]. It is also features [b]extremely flexible steering[/b], able to do a [b]180 degree[/b] turn in just [b]0.44 earthly seconds[/b].");
global._0r=_8o("Strings","l_desc_sta","[b]The Starii[/b]#A [b]Torii-shaped[/b] intergalactic transport, whose hull is composed [b]entirely of wood[/b]. How it got out of the atmosphere unscathed [b]is still kept secret[/b] by its manufacturers. It is seen as an achievement combining [b]traditional culture[/b] with [b]state-of-the-art technology[/b], both of which the country of origin is [b]famous[/b] for.");global._1r=_8o("Strings","l_desc_met","[b]The Meteore[/b]#A spaceship built in the [b]bowels of a meteor[/b]. Originally a mining site famous for its [b]rare materials[/b], but when depleted, the mining shafts quickly gave way for [b]cockpits and control rooms[/b] to use the meteor as [b]camouflage for stealth missions[/b]. Later, was sold to an [b]a family of rich Martians[/b] who started using the ship as [b]luxury housing[/b].");
global._2r=_8o("Strings","l_desc_sfh","[b]The Star Fix Headquarters[/b]#Star Fix [b]is the main competitor of the Mobility[/b]. Where the latter has built [b]long term relationships[/b] with its customers, Star Fix simply [b]wants to score a quick buck[/b], operating in areas the Mobility doesn't service. Their base of operations is a [b]spaceship consisting of three rings[/b], with the [b]CEO's office in the middle.[/b]");global._3r=_8o("Strings","l_desc_boss","[b]The Star Fix's Chief executive officer[/b]#The master brain behind the plan to put the [b]Mobility out of service[/b], but his plans [b]backfired[/b] leaving his company [b]bankrupt[/b]. The [b]Battlebot[/b], specialized at melee attacks and equipped with [b]extendable arms[/b], is the only thing left standing between you and him.");
